        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fuel elements BWR, UO2 4.0% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fuel elements BWR, UO2 4.0% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant
The shares are the same as estimated for German BWRs, assuming this is about reflecting the average UCTE condition. The indication of data validity inputted in "TimePeriod" only says that the shares represent the knowledge available today of the likely fuel management for the UCTE light water reactors.;
UUID: 5f352a4d-3415-3b2c-9166-a09a48ba74d7
The module consists of the share of UO2 and MOX fuel elements.
Location: UCTE conditions
Technology: Data reflects the use of UO2 and MOX fuel elements in current nuclear reactors.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5f352a4d-3415-3b2c-9166-a09a48ba74d7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
